'''Wicked Flames''' (邪龍黒炎波, ''Jaryū Kokuenha'', '''Wicked Dragon Black Flame Wave''') is a 3-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 12.3 Update|Version 12.3]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
Unit Defense UP (M): Cats' health increases by 20%.

