==Trivia==
*All of the kanji in Wicked Flames' Japanese name (邪龍黒炎波 ''Jaryū Kokuenha'', "Wicked Dragon Black Flame Wave") are also present in the Japanese name of [[wikia:yuyuhakusho:Dragon of the Darkness Flame|Dragon of the Darkness Flame]] (邪王炎殺黒龍波 ''Jaō Ensatsu Kokuryūha'', "Wicked King Immolation Black Dragon Wave"), a technique used by [[wikia:yuyuhakusho:Hiei|Hiei]] in the manga and anime ''[[wikipedia:YuYu Hakusho|YuYu Hakusho]]''.

